Scholars home and abroad have been researching into the origin of Matouqin.Among all the opinions,two are more popular.One is the theoy Hobus ancestor,the other is the interence of Yekle amestor.The auther thinks that the Hobus in Tang Dynasty is the remote ancestor and the horse tail huqin in Song Dynasty should be the orginal ancestor of Matongin.The pedigree of Matouqin should be:Hobus——masson Huqin(Hobus style Chaowur,a bowstring Sugud)——Huqin(Hori style Chaowur,Yekle)——Matouqin.\;
